Revision history for Mojolicious-Plugin-FormRequest

0.01  2026-10-19
  - Initial scaffold and plugin registration
  - Core FormRequest base class, Validator, app helper
  - Full non-DB rule set, wildcards, nullable, sometimes
  - unique and exists backed by configurable DB resolver
  - prepareForValidation, afterValidation, stopOnFirstFailure, password rule
  - distinct, prohibited, required_if family, rule-object support
  - validated(), validate_or_fail(), typed Exception
  - Plain validator facade and Rule::in/not_in/unique/exists helpers
  - POD for the main module
